LUMA SUMMARY:
Browser-access redesign. Because someone wanted to use Edge instead of Opera, the team specifies a browser-access layer: configurable CDP endpoint, detection of usable existing browsers, browser selection/launch when necessary, isolated profiles, and clean handling of node session timeouts. This is the conceptual precursor to Q-Tip/browser-independence work.
